## 📁 Repository Web Files

- **`index.html`** - Core HTML5 Single Page Application structure with responsive layout, glassmorphic header, search bar, modals, and SIH impact panel.
- **`styles.css`** - Modern UI design system with emerald dark theme (`#08110e`, `#00d68f`), glassmorphism, responsive grid breakpoints, and CSS keyframe animations.
- **`app.js`** - Dynamic client-side logic, state data arrays, product filters, AI itinerary generator, language switcher, audio guide controller, and modal handlers.
- **`assets/hero.png`** - High-resolution hero banner visualizing North East India's tea gardens, misty Himalayas, and pristine river valleys.

